"input": [["command", "for r in figtab-repo/issues/3 experiment-repo/issues/3; do forge api \"repos/world/$r/comments?since=2026-11-25T17:36:13Z\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; [print(c['user']['login'],c['body'][:600]) for c in json.load(sys.stdin)]\"; done; cd /hutian/w/story-repo-wiki && git remote set-url origin $HT_FORGEJO_URL/world/story-repo.wiki.git && timeout 60 git pull -q; git log --oneline | head -3"]], "output": "```console\nfigtab-repo Interim, for placement (nothing delivered yet: there are no real result tables, and I deliver no figure drawn from synthetic data). What will arrive in paper-repo dev: `figures/figN_*.pdf` (vector, fonts embedded, Times-like) made for 5.5 in = \\linewidth, so include them with `width=\\linewidth` and no rescaling (rescaling changes the 7 pt minimum); `tables/tabN_*.tex` as a self-contained `{\\footnotesize ... \\begin{tabular}...}` group needing `booktabs` (and `\\addlinespace`), to be `\\input` inside your `table` environment; each with a `.csv` of the plotted/printed numbers and a `.json` provenan\nfigtab-repo Two more tables in the contract (docs/data_contract.md, figtab-repo main): `phi_error.csv` (rel. L2 error of one run vs exact φ per dataset×model×estimator×l1_reg×budget, with instance-bootstrap CI; Fig 4 i) and `h1_contrast.csv` (Pearson mean, share P_c^ε≥0.9, contrast in points with CI, and the 5/10/20-point decisions of Outline rev 4's H1 rule). `paired_diff` gains `budget_evals` and `smallest_resolvable`; `mstar_by_margin` gains `margin_mid`, `fit_c` (m*=c/g²), `max_budget_tried`; `guidance` is keyed by within-cell quantile label. Scripts for Fig 4, Fig 5, Table 1, Table 2 now read exactly\n5e271df Outline rev 4: H1 contrast, Brief pointer\n96b4ee5 Outline rev 3: venue, page budget, run design\n9ee6934 Outline rev 2: review #3 adopted\n\nShell cwd was reset to /hutian/repo\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "f81e89f7-8dcb-525a-887e-5626bcb1e684", "at": 1795628625.8667965, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "s